# Rules apply only when no static file matches (existing /assets/*, /llms.txt,
# /robots.txt, /sitemap.xml are served from the build output and never
# rewritten).
#
# Missing /assets/* must NOT fall through to the SPA fallback: clients holding
# a previous deploy's shell import retired hashed chunks, and HTML answered as
# JavaScript kills the boot with no recovery. Serve a real JS module that
# self-heals the client instead (see public/assets-recover.js).
/assets/*    /assets-recover.js    200

# SPA fallback for client routes.
/*    /index.html   200
